===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|eo|it|felice}}, from {{der|eo|la|felix|fēlīx, fēlīcem}}. Cognate with {{cog|fr|félicité|t=happiness, bliss|pos=noun}}, {{cog|en|felicity|pos=noun}}.

